<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.5in">Emerging growth company&#160;<span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span id="xdx_907_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20230124__20230124_zgQ4BsgYselh"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-01-24to2023-01-24" format="ixt:booleantrue" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#120;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">If an emerging growth company, indicate by check
mark if the registrant has elected not to use the extended transition period for complying with any new or revised financial accounting
standards provided pursuant to Section 13(a) of the Exchange Act.&#160;<span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span id="xdx_90C_edei--EntityExTransitionPeriod_c20230124__20230124_z8sTZZIqXIxg"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2023-01-24to2023-01-24" format="ixt:booleanfalse" name="dei:EntityExTransitionPeriod">&#168;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></span></p>

